WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.860
The Plough, and the way north.

00:02.560 --> 00:11.234
Seven stars that Britain calls the Plough, America the Big Dipper and much of Europe a wagon: they are the back and tail of the Great Bear.

00:11.684 --> 00:17.137
Take the two stars at the end of the bowl and follow them up, five times their own gap.

00:17.587 --> 00:23.449
That lone star is Polaris, and it sits almost exactly over the Earth's north pole.
